Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "Ganondorf has stolen Hyrule Castle from us.
We will not let him do the same with Hyrule!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "The awakening ritual needs more time...
Argoroks! Stall them!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Battling two dragons would be reckless!
Defeating them individually is smarter!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "Leave the Argorok in the north to us.
If we do this together, it'll be easy!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Our allies are meeting us here! Everyone,
hold your ground!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "We can handle the Argorok to the south.
Strike together and we will succeed!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Just a little more patience, brothers! We've
got weapons heading to the North Square!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "There's a weak spot in the castle wall!
A Bombchu should break through easily!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Excellent! Now take care of the other
Argorok!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "The two Argoroks have been defeated! That
should give us a moment to catch our breath.",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Argoroks! Show the Hyrulean Forces just
how terrifying Twilit dragons can be!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "The pair have teamed up... If we can't
defeat them, we'll keep losing soldiers!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Advance and protect the Bombchu!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "The Argorok's targeting the Bombchu!
We have to take care of that dragon fast!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "The enemy is growing restless... We must do
something soon, or else we may be done for!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Protect the Bombchu! We need it if we
wanna break through that wall!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "The Bombchu managed to open a hole!
Hurry! We have to press on!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "The plan was a failure! But how...?
There must be another way.",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Ha! Their plan failed--now's our chance! All
forces, advance! Crush them in one attack!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "I'll personally cut down the Hyrulean
Forces at their roots!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Ganondorf himself has entered the fray!
Everyone, keep your focus!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Lightning! Don't touch it or you'll be
electrocuted!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Watch out for his lightning attacks!
Ganondorf is extremely dangerous!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "The Dark Power is growing too strong...
Ganondorf's strength is too much!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "The east side of the castle is weak!
Enter the castle and take it!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "If we capture the castle, our foe's morale
will drop, causing the Dark Power to wane!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Now! Take the castle!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "We have taken back Hyrule Castle!
Ganondorf, you have lost!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Arrrgh. My base is taken, and with it
goes my minions' morale...",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Taking the castle while I was away? Clever.
You even managed to drain my power.",
  "1.0.30.0" => "This moment decides everything!
You must defeat Ganondorf!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "A single misstep will cost us everything!
Take the castle as fast as you can!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Ha. You may have defeated this form...
But my true power has already awakened!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Ganon's Tower is still controlled by our
enemy, but at least Ganondorf is no more!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Ha... HA! You've succeeded at NOTHING!
This body fails, but my true power is awoken!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Ganondorf is beaten! Now is the time to
take back the castle!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "They've taken my base?! Curse them! This is
what I get for having WORTHLESS soldiers!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Ganondorf is defeated, and the castle is
under our control! We are victorious!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Heh. As long as my true power is
awakened...I CAN NEVER BE DEFEATED!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "I...am...GANON!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Be brave! If we defeat Ganon, light will return
to Hyrule and this war will be at an end!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Defeating Ganon will stop the lightning!
Hurry! Before the castle is burned to cinders!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "The castle is suffering some heavy lightning
damage! We have to defeat Ganon right away!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "The lightning damage has become severe!
The castle will crumble any minute now...",
  "1.0.44.0" => "The castle is in serious danger! We have
to defeat Ganon immediately!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Watch Ganon's movements closely! I'm sure
we've encountered patterns like those before!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "You must have an item that can damage
Ganon! Don't give up!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "Here--take the Light Arrows! Use them to
deliver the finishing blow to Ganon!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "The Light Arrows' power is weak... 
We must not have very many allies left...",
  "1.0.49.0" => "If only more had survived, the Light
Arrows could have gathered more energy...",
  "1.0.50.0" => "The Light Arrows have gathered enough
energy! Finish Ganon off once and for all!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "I'll put all the energy I've got into the
arrows!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "All the energy I have...I place in the Light
Arrows!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "The Light Arrows can have all my energy
too!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Any magic I have left...
The Light Arrows can have it!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "I, too, place my energy and trust in the Light
Arrows. May they help us restore peace!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Urgh... I have to give them credit...",
  "1.0.57.0" => "It looks like it's working!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "Fight until the battle's end!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Why... Why do they keep resisting me...?
Why don't they just give up...?",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Just a little bit more!",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Victory is a step away! Finish him!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "HA HA HA! Hyrule...is...MINE!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "No... We came so close... How could we
lose...?",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Hyrule...is...MINE! Now, bow to your
Demon King!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "Our base has fallen... This battle is lost...",
  "1.0.66.0" => "I think...this is where King Dodongo broke
through during a previous battle!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "Link, I'm sending your strength to the
Light Arrows as well!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "Yes, yes! The enemy's lost its will to
fight!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "I'm not afraid of Ganondorf! I'll bring the
pain while you take the castle back!",
  "1.0.70.0" => "I'll hold out against Ganondorf as long as I
can. In the meantime, recapture the castle!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Focus on taking the castle! I can hold my
own against Ganondorf, no problem!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "I'll try and buy you some time! That means
you have to take the castle! Hurry!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "No, not yet... I require more time to reach
my full strength...",
  "1.0.74.0" => "Just a little while longer... I can feel my
power beginning to surge...",
  "1.0.75.0" => "My true power has been awoken! Now there's
no one, hero or goddess, who can defeat me!",
  "1.0.76.0" => "The enemy is approaching from behind!
Protect the princess!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "Do they mean to harm the princess?",
  "1.0.78.0" => "The enemy's forces are closing in on the
princess from the north! I must help her!",
  "1.0.79.0" => "What should we do? Enemies are
everywhere!",
  "1.0.80.0" => "Calm down! Our first and most important
mission is to keep Zelda safe!",
  "1.0.81.0" => "There. The immediate threat is taken care
of.",
  "1.0.82.0" => "Leave the rest of the enemies to me!",
  "1.0.83.0" => "Keep at it! We'll extinguish that foolish
light!",
  "1.0.84.0" => "How can they...have so much strength...?",
  "1.0.85.0" => "If we defeat those enemies, we should be
able to restore power to the Light Arrows!",
  "1.0.86.0" => "We defeated one, but there are two more!",
  "1.0.87.0" => "The second one's down!",
  "1.0.88.0" => "Just one more, and the Light Arrows will
be at full strength!",
  "1.0.89.0" => "The Light Arrows have been restored to their
former glory! Now, Ganon will surely fall!",
  "1.0.90.0" => "I took down all the enemies over here!",
  "1.0.91.0" => "I'll keep the princess safe.",
  "1.0.92.0" => "The enemy forces are dwindling! Now's
our chance to stop Ganondorf!",
  "1.0.93.0" => "If we all work together, victory is assured!",
  "1.0.94.0" => "Oh no... Protect the Bombchu! Don't let
them destroy it!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "Attacking two dragons at once is foolish!
We need to defeat them before they join up!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "Leave the north dragon to us! If we attack
it together, it will fall in no time!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "Help is on the way! Just hold out until
it arrives!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "The dragon of the south is ours! If we
attack it together, it will surely perish!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "Have patience, everyone! We'll have a
powerful weapon in the North Square soon!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "There's a weak spot on the castle wall!
Let's use a Bombchu to knock it down!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "Excellent! Now you just need to take care
of the other dragon!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "Perfect! Both dragons have been defeated!
That should give us some breathing room!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "Drat, the dragons have rendezvoused...
Defeat them now, before it gets worse!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "March forward while protecting the
Bombchu!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "My goodness, our enemies just won't let up...
We'll be finished if we don't do something!",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Defend the Bombchu! We can't break
through the castle's wall without it!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "Wonderful! Now, into the opening the
Bombchu created for us!",
  "13.0.13.0" => "The Bombchu plan failed... Now what do
we do...?",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Ganondorf himself has appeared! Proceed
with extreme caution, but don't lose focus!",
  "13.0.15.0" => "The Dark Power is growing... Ganondorf is
becoming more dangerous every second!",
  "13.0.16.0" => "The east side of the castle is weak!
We can enter from there!",
  "13.0.17.0" => "If we capture the castle, Ganondorf's power
will wane and his army's morale will fall!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "This moment decides everything!
Defeat Ganondorf!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "Ganon's Tower may still be standing, but
at least Ganondorf has been defeated!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "Ganondorf is defeated! Now is the time to
take back the castle!",
  "13.0.21.0" => "Don't fear the Ganon beast! It's powerful,
but it's still mortal! Strike it down!",
  "13.0.22.0" => "You'll need the Light Arrows! Here--use
them to finish Ganon off!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "The Light Arrows have gathered enough
energy! Let's rid the world of Ganon!",
  "13.0.24.0" => "I'm putting all my strength into the arrow!",
  "13.0.25.0" => "I'm putting all my strength into this arrow!",
  "13.0.26.0" => "I'll pour my strength into the arrow as
well!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "Don't waste the strength I've given you!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "All of my strength has been placed in that
arrow! You'd better make this one count!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "We've used up every last ounce of our
strength...",
  "13.0.30.0" => "We've lost our base! Without it, how
can we continue...?",
  "13.0.31.0" => "Hmm... This looks like the place where
King Dodongo once broke through!",
  "13.0.32.0" => "Watch Ganon's movements closely! I'm
sure you've fought a similar enemy before!",
  "13.0.33.0" => "There must be some way to damage Ganon...
Have you tried every item you have?",
  "13.0.34.0" => "The Light Arrows are so weak... Is it
because so many allies have fallen?",
  "13.0.35.0" => "If only all of our friends were still with
us. Then maybe we'd have succeeded...",
  "13.0.36.0" => "If we defeat Ganon, those thunderbolts will
stop! Take him out before it's too late!",
  "13.0.37.0" => "The lightning strikes are too much for the
castle! We have to do something!",
  "13.0.38.0" => "It's now or never! Quickly, capture the
keep!",
  "13.0.39.0" => "I'll distract Ganondorf! You go capture
the keep!",
  "13.0.40.0" => "You have to capture the castle! I can
keep Ganondorf preoccupied while you do!",
  "13.0.41.0" => "Let me distract Ganondorf while you take
the keep! Hurry! I won't last long!",
  "13.0.42.0" => "I'll make Ganondorf my top priority while
you focus on taking that keep. But hurry!",
  "13.0.43.0" => "We've finally recaptured Hyrule Castle!
Ganondorf, you are defeated!",
  "13.0.44.0" => "I'll attack Ganondorf while he's in the Castle
Keep! There's no time to argue! Let's go!",
  "13.0.45.0" => "Ganondorf has fallen and we've recaptured
the castle! Victory belongs to us!",
  "13.0.46.0" => "We've recaptured the Castle Keep! Ganondorf,
you've lost! Deal with the shame!",
  "13.0.47.0" => "The Light Arrows have been restored to their
former glory! Ganon will soon meet his doom!",
  "13.0.48.0" => "The Light Arrows are restored! There's no
way Ganon will be able to defeat us now!",
  "13.0.49.0" => "There are enemies behind us as well!
We need to keep Zelda safe!",
  "13.0.50.0" => "Enemies are attacking Zelda from the north!
We have to help her!",
  "13.0.51.0" => "Stay calm, everyone! Zelda's safety is our
main concern!",
  "13.0.52.0" => "It appears that we're safe, for now,
anyway.",
  "13.0.53.0" => "Leave the rest of our foes to me!",
  "13.0.54.0" => "I've taken care of a handful of our
attackers!",
  "13.0.55.0" => "Leave Zelda's safety to me!",
  "13.0.56.0" => "Unbelievable. I can't believe that they still
have some fight left in them!",
  "13.0.57.0" => "They still have enough strength to fight?
That's incredible...and worrisome.",
  "13.0.58.0" => "Still, if we defeat those enemies, the Light
Arrows will regain their former strength!",
  "13.0.59.0" => "But we can't let that stop us! If we defeat those
enemies, the Light Arrows will regain their power!",
  "13.0.60.0" => "If we all work together, then nothing will
stand between us and victory!",
  "13.0.61.0" => "Enemies from behind as well...
Princess Ruto is in trouble!",
  "13.0.62.0" => "Enemies are attacking Princess Ruto
from the north! We need to protect her!",
}